@page
@model InnManagerWebsite.Pages.AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}
<h1>About InnManager</h1>

<p>InnManager is a hotel management application developed by Tegan Brown, a student at Kansas State University. The application provides functionality for managing hotel rooms, reservations, guests, housekeeping operations, invoices, payments, employees, and services. The desktop application is built using WPF, while the web interface is developed using ASP.NET Core Razor Pages.</p>
